# Drix Fatemaker: the counter may go on the opponent's Ornithopter, which Bot1 does not control and so gains no trample (CR 613.1f); nor does Drix, with no counter.

[Bot1 Deck]
Black Lotus
Mox Emerald
Drix Fatemaker
Island x16

[Bot2 Deck]
Ornithopter
Island x17

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Black Lotus.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Emerald.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
[T2 Bot2.Main1]
Bot2.Hand.Ornithopter.Cast
[T3 Bot1.Main1]
Bot1.Battlefield.Black Lotus.Activate(Color: Green)
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Emerald.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Drix Fatemaker.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
Bot1.Target(Bot2.Battlefield.Ornithopter)
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass

[Expect]
Bot2.Battlefield.Ornithopter.Counters.PlusOnePlusOne = 1
Bot2.Battlefield.Ornithopter.Keywords = Flying
Bot1.Battlefield.Drix Fatemaker.Keywords = (absent)
